#: kio_locate.cpp:340
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<h1>\"%1\" could not be started.</h1><p>Please note that kio-locate can't be "
"used on its own. You need an additional program for doing searches. "
"Typically this is the command line tool <i>locate</i> that can be found in "
"many distributions by default. You can check if the correct tool is used by "
"looking at the <a href=\"locater:config\">setting</a> \"Locate Binary\".</"
"p><p>Besides the mentioned tool <i>locate</i>, kio-locate can use any tool "
"that uses the same syntax. In particular, it was reported to work with "
"<i>slocate</i> and <i>rlocate</i></p>."
msgstr ""
"<h1>\"%1\" nije moglo započeti.</h1><p>Imajte na umu da kio-locate se ne "
"može koristiti sam za sebe. Treba vam dodatni program za pretrage. Tipično "
"je ovo alat na komandnoj liniji <i>locate</i> koji može biti nađen u mnogim "
"distribucijama prema zadanim postavkama. Možete provjeriti da li je pravi "
"alat korišten gledajuću u <a href=\"locater:config\">postavke</a> \"Lociraj "
"binarno\".</p><p>Pored spomenutog alata <i>locate</i>, kio-locate može "
"koristiti bilo koji alat koji koristi istu sintaksu. Posebno, prijavljeno je "
"da radi sa <i>slocate</i> i <i>rlocate</i></p>."

